{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S06、S07、S13的感受描述较密，即使分时出现，也容易让观众分神追词；X的双栏短词更方便快速回扫。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的话语重点有明显视觉锚点，感受文字又较小且按音乐时点出现，扫读时能区分主次，不必同时处理所有内容。更重要的是，Y把怀念亲近、想起受气、害怕孤单、不愿再次委屈自己、最终带着想念继续生活的因果链交代得更清楚，前后呼应也更充分。它对音乐织体、节奏、音色和情绪转折的描述尤其细致，X虽然更轻快易扫，但不少感受停留在并列的情绪提示，人物心理与音乐变化的对应没有Y那么深入。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c6912280-00a6-4db2-af13-3b2178cd3418", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T002328614144Z", "elapsed_seconds": 138.547, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:25:47.162679+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b7b73db12f477d4d09948d36d51cf2ad7a9866ddb87897f62520b5ed86011bb2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt